% Keep the display heading with a meaningful opening block.  Titlesec's
% article-class chapter does not provide the book classes' page-break guard,
% so an explicit reserve prevents a chapter label and title from being left at
% the foot of a page while the chapter itself begins on the next one.
\pretocmd{\chapter}{\Needspace{12\baselineskip}}{}{
  \PackageError{course-format}{Could not install chapter page-break guard}{}
}

