\newcommand{\StudyLoop}{%
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item Read one coherent teaching section and follow every worked example.
    \item Copy its paradigms, vocabulary forms, and model Latin by hand.
    \item Close the teaching pages and retrieve the new forms, words,
          definitions, and contrasts before checking them.
    \item Read the assigned Latin and complete its sentence-building or
          composition work without consulting the answers.
    \item Use contrasting practice variants now and preserve others for later
          returns. Correct in another color and state the rule behind each
          substantive correction; the four printed variants are a repetition
          bank, not a page quota.
    \item Use the packet's cumulative practice on fresh material. Continue
          when its listed abilities are reasonably dependable; otherwise
          repeat the named explanation or memory sheet and try different Latin.
  \end{enumerate}}

